    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your worth in this <strong>brutal Action-Adventure</strong> inspired by <strong>Heroic Fantasy Classics</strong>.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crush your enemies</strong>, struggle against fate and become the usurper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every victory, as well as defeat, depends more on your own combat prowess, rather than the strength of your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine every combat tactic at your disposal. Whether you prefer <strong>attacking</strong> head-on, <strong>defending</strong> strategically, <strong>parrying</strong>, <strong>dodging</strong> or <strong>counterattacking</strong>, you can adapt your playstyle without being constrained by any class-specific stats.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Skill-based, Brutal Combat</strong> - Combine various strikes to break your enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/82ff5f9ae6c19154b28478e2498ce33c.poster.avif?t=1744144336\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/82ff5f9ae6c19154b28478e2498ce33c.webm?t=1744144336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/82ff5f9ae6c19154b28478e2498ce33c.mp4?t=1744144336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging</strong>\u00a0<strong>Enemies\u00a0</strong>- Face opponents who will keep you on your toes and challenge your tactics.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/15628a25d98b72351d52abc45528dadb.poster.avif?t=1744144336\" width=622 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/15628a25d98b72351d52abc45528dadb.webm?t=1744144336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/15628a25d98b72351d52abc45528dadb.mp4?t=1744144336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Weapons</strong> - Crush, slice, stab or fist your way through your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct Environments</strong> - Travel from grim dungeons to snowy temples in a series of semi-open levels. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/5efd9b468e5bcceae237c9a335d5df18.poster.avif?t=1744144336\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/5efd9b468e5bcceae237c9a335d5df18.webm?t=1744144336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679830/extras/5efd9b468e5bcceae237c9a335d5df18.mp4?t=1744144336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
